```
Reason:
The fix involves correctly placing the `smp_mb()` memory barriers around the `__cmpxchg()` macro instead of the `____cmpxchg()` variants. This ensures that the memory operations are properly ordered without introducing unnecessary barriers, thus restoring the intended functionality and performance of the operations on the Alpha architecture.

